OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mostly dry day     
OL,6,Fwith some good spells of sunshine.     
OL,7,FChance of the odd passing shower       
OL,8,Facross the northwest. Light            
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly wind.                    
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with 
OL,12,Fclear periods and a few frost fog      
OL,13,Fpatches. Then staying dry for the rest 
OL,14,Fof the night although turning rather   
OL,15,Fcloudy.                                
OL,17,CSaturday:FAfter a dry start thickening 
OL,18,Fcloud will bring some rain from the    
OL,19,Fsouthwest in the afternoon. Fresh to   
OL,20,Fstrong southerly winds, easing in the  
OL,21,Fafternoon.                             
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
